# 换行与二进制约定
# 训练服务器是 Linux：仓库内统一 LF，避免 CRLF 导致 build.sh 出现
# "bad interpreter" 一类问题。本机 core.autocrlf 曾为 true，靠这里固定下来。

* text=auto eol=lf

# 明确按二进制处理，禁止任何换行转换
*.STL binary
*.stl binary
*.STP binary
*.step binary
*.pt binary
*.pth binary
*.ckpt binary
*.onnx binary
*.jit binary
*.pb binary
*.so binary
*.a binary
*.dll binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.pdf binary
*.gz binary
*.zip binary
